<title>JAPAN: Japan 3-month T-bill auction lowest price at 99.90.</title>
<headline>Japan 3-month T-bill auction lowest price at 99.90.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finance Ministry said its auction of 1.2 trillion yen worth of three-month Treasury bills on Wednesday produced the following results:</p>
<p> Lowest price     99.900  Stop rate     0.397 pct</p>
<p> Average price    99.903  Average yield 0.382 pct</p>
<p> Total bids	   5.7160 trillion yen</p>
<p> Accepted Bids	1.1997 trillion yen</p>
<p> Bid to cover ratio 4.76  times</p>
<p> Bids accepted at lowest price 6.8663 pct</p>
<p> Issue date	 Oct 21, 1996</p>
<p> Maturity    Jan 20, 1997</p>
</text>
